故有呂、郤之患。」乃多與公子雍衞。太子母繆嬴日夜抱太子以號泣於朝，曰：「先君何罪？其嗣亦何罪？舍適而外求君，將安置此？」出朝，則抱以適趙盾所，頓首曰：「先君奉此子而屬之子，曰『此子材，吾受其賜；不材，吾怨子』。今君卒，言猶在耳，而棄之，若何？」趙盾與諸大夫皆患繆嬴，且畏誅，乃背所迎而立太子夷皋，是爲靈公。發兵以距秦送公子雍者。趙盾爲將，往撃秦，敗之令狐。先蔑、隨會亡奔秦。秋，齊、宋、衞、鄭、曹、許君皆會趙盾，盟於扈，以靈公初立故也。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p084","quote":"四年，伐秦，取少梁。秦亦取晉之郩。六年，秦康公伐晉，取羈馬。晉侯怒，使趙盾、趙穿、郤缺撃秦，大戰河曲，趙穿最有功。七年，晉六卿患隨會之在秦，常爲晉亂，乃詳令魏壽餘反晉降秦。秦使隨會之魏，因執會以歸晉。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p039","text":"三十九年，繆公卒，葬雍。從死者百七十七人，秦之良臣子輿氏三人名曰奄息、仲行、鍼虎，亦在從死之中。秦人哀之，為作歌黃鳥之詩。君子曰：「秦繆公廣地益國，東服彊晉，西霸戎夷，然不為諸侯盟主，亦宜哉。死而棄民，收其良臣而從死。且先王崩，尚猶遺德垂法，況奪之善人良臣百姓所哀者乎？是以知秦不能復東征也。」繆公子四十人，其太子嵤代立，是為康公。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0025","start":25,"end":30,"surface":"子輿氏三人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0032","start":32,"end":34,"surface":"奄息","kind":"person","person_id":"ofo_goq_gfx","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"仲行","kind":"person","person_id":"s7q_qps_pba","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"鍼虎","kind":"person","person_id":"qw1_usz_nyt","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0066","start":66,"end":69,"surface":"秦繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0110","start":110,"end":112,"surface":"先王","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0147","start":147,"end":149,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0149","start":149,"end":153,"surface":"子四十人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、群體或待核指代；不由官稱或熟知世系補造個人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0155","start":155,"end":158,"surface":"太子嵤","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m039-0163","start":163,"end":165,"surface":"康公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-005-qin","book_id":"b-shiji-005","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-005-qin"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:p040","text":"康公元年。往歲繆公之卒，晉襄公亦卒；襄公之弟名雍，秦出也，在秦。晉趙盾欲立之，使隨會來迎雍，秦以兵送至令狐。晉立襄公子而反擊秦師，秦師敗，隨會來奔。二年，秦伐晉，取武城，報令狐之役。四年，晉伐秦，取少梁。六年，秦伐晉，取羈馬。戰於河曲，大敗晉軍。晉人患隨會在秦為亂，乃使魏讎餘詳反，合謀會，詐而得會，會遂歸晉。康公立十二年卒，子共公立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"康公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0007","start":7,"end":9,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"晉襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"襄公","kind":"person","person_id":"kat_48c_thr","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0023","start":23,"end":24,"surface":"雍","kind":"person","person_id":"ga0_0p4_5xy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0032","start":32,"end":35,"surface":"晉趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0040","start":40,"end":42,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"wt0_abc_2sk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-005-qin:m040-0044","start":44,"end":45,"surface":"雍","kind":"person","person_id":"ga0_0p4_5xy