衞。太子母繆嬴日夜抱太子以號泣於朝，曰：「先君何罪？其嗣亦何罪？舍適而外求君，將安置此？」出朝，則抱以適趙盾所，頓首曰：「先君奉此子而屬之子，曰『此子材，吾受其賜；不材，吾怨子』。今君卒，言猶在耳，而棄之，若何？」趙盾與諸大夫皆患繆嬴，且畏誅，乃背所迎而立太子夷皋，是爲靈公。發兵以距秦送公子雍者。趙盾爲將，往撃秦，敗之令狐。先蔑、隨會亡奔秦。秋，齊、宋、衞、鄭、曹、許君皆會趙盾，盟於扈，以靈公初立故也。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"jmz_qgu_bq0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0007","start":7,"end":10,"surface":"秦康公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0014","start":14,"end":16,"surface":"文公","kind":"person","person_id":"6di_ywz_ju4_AAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0034","start":34,"end":37,"surface":"公子雍","kind":"person","person_id":"ga0_0p4_5xy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0039","start":39,"end":44,"surface":"太子母繆嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"qvb_bff_vk4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0089","start":89,"end":91,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0144","start":144,"end":146,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"繆嬴","kind":"person","person_id":"qvb_bff_vk4","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0165","start":165,"end":169,"surface":"太子夷皋","kind":"person","person_id":"jmz_qgu_bq0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0172","start":172,"end":174,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"jmz_qgu_bq0","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0181","start":181,"end":184,"surface":"公子雍","kind":"person","person_id":"ga0_0p4_5xy","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0186","start":186,"end":188,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0200","start":200,"end":202,"surface":"先蔑","kind":"person","person_id":"s3b_svm_zf2","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0203","start":203,"end":205,"surface":"隨會","kind":"person","person_id":"wt0_abc_2sk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0211","start":211,"end":223,"surface":"齊、宋、衞、鄭、曹、許君","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、職官泛稱、校勘、神異或未定指代；不補未見名、成員、爵等或闕代。"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0224","start":224,"end":225,"surface":"會","kind":"person","person_id":"wt0_abc_2sk","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0225","start":225,"end":227,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m083-0233","start":233,"end":235,"surface":"靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"jmz_qgu_bq0","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-039-jin","book_id":"b-shiji-039","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-039-jin"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p084","text":"四年，伐秦，取少梁。秦亦取晉之郩。六年，秦康公伐晉，取羈馬。晉侯怒，使趙盾、趙穿、郤缺撃秦，大戰河曲，趙穿最有功。七年，晉六卿患隨會之在秦，常爲晉亂，乃詳令魏壽餘反晉降秦。秦使隨會之魏，因執會以歸晉。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0020","start":20,"end":23,"surface":"秦康公","kind":"person","person_id":"y97_huh_vuz_AAAAAA","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0035","start":35,"end":37,"surface":"趙盾","kind":"person","person_id":"dm0_58v_50i_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0038","start":38,"end":40,"surface":"趙穿","kind":"person","person_id":"dxn_drv_maj","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0041","start":41,"end":43,"surface":"郤缺","kind":"person","person_id":"atj_f3h_1y6","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-039-jin:m084-0051","start":51,"end":53,"surf